    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d212">

                <pb facs="0960" n="810" xml:id="pg810"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Wilson to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Brussels</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-10-16"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 16, 1907</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 241.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith the
                    copy in the English text of the bill for a colonial law offered by the present
                    ministry and which is now being discussed by the special committee of Parliament
                    appointed for that purpose.</p>
                <p>This commission has been meeting in regular session for some time past, and each
                    article of the proposed law has been subjected to rigid scrutiny and has
                    provoked long debates, numerous amendments being offered, some of which are
                    valuable additions to the law and others of an impractical character.</p>
                <p>As there is no official report of the proceedings it is difficult to know the
                    amount of progress that has been made and what changes, if any, have been
                    recommended.</p>
                <p>The principal objection of the opposition is to Article XIX, which contains the
                    provision for a colonial council of nine members, to be nominated by the
                    King.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry Lane
                    Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d212-a1.xml" xpointer="d212-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
